data_wagner1999_ssz48_table5_framework
_audit_creation_method 'Transcribed from the author-reported Table 5; independent asset audit pending'
_chemical_name_common 'Calcined SSZ-48: author-refined Si/O framework model only'
_publ_section_comment
;
Source: Wagner et al., J. Phys. Chem. B 1999, 103, 8245-8250.
DOI: 10.1021/jp991389j. Main Table 5, printed page 8250;
cell and measurement details from Table 4, printed page 8249.
This is a transcription of the reported average Si/O framework refinement,
not coordinates for a complete nanocrystal or a composition-complete specimen.
The source reports a borosilicate sample; B site occupancies are unresolved.
No B, H, Na, organic species or unreported occupancies have been invented.
Reported coordinate and displacement uncertainties are retained literally.
The standard unique-b P21 setting and its two symmetry operations are used.
Alpha and gamma of 90 degrees follow this monoclinic setting, rather than
independent measured angle entries in the source table.
;
